# Private audit and release-evidence files are kept outside this repository.
# Only their SHA-256 digests belong in the release manifest.
docs/audits/
docs/proposals/
datasets/

# Rust IV5 layer: third-party crates are restored with `cargo vendor` and are
# verified against the SHA-256 checksums pinned in Cargo.lock, so they do not
# belong in history. The pinned monero-oxide sources under rust/upstream/ ARE
# tracked: they are path dependencies with no crates.io equivalent.
# Release builds ship vendor/ as a signed archive for air-gapped reproducibility.
src/privacy_vnext/rust/vendor/
src/privacy_vnext/rust/target/
src/privacy_vnext/rust/upstream/target/
